1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Household Ops Agent - demo for the Meta Global AI Developer Hackathon,
Indie Developer Track: Build for Your World.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:22,000
The problem: evenings are a decision problem.
Goal: dinner and a quick kitchen reset after work.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:38,000
npm run demo - Muse Spark 1.3 turns the goal, constraints and inventory
into three owned steps with reasons.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Grounded perception with SAM 3.1: with a photo it detects household objects.
This run skips it honestly and says so.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Execution trace: every model stage visible.
Mock output is always labeled mock - never fakes a live API call.

6
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:14,000
One API key switches to live mode via OpenAI-compatible
Meta Model API endpoints, with a deterministic mock fallback.

7
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Three tests pass on node:test:
the photo-assisted path and the no-photo fallback.

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Try it: public repository on GitHub -
npm install && npm test && npm run demo.
